# The build stage runs `npm ci` and then `COPY . .`. Without this file the copy
# drops the host's node_modules over the Linux install — native binaries built
# for macOS — and `vite build` fails inside the container. It also copied .env
# into the image, which is how a local brand or API URL got baked in by accident.
node_modules
dist
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.log
.vite.pid
*.tsbuildinfo
.git
